#: src/data/contest_moves.h:6
msgid "Quite the appealing move."
msgstr "非常吸引人的表演。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:8
msgid "A highly appealing move."
msgstr "非常吸引人的表演。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:17
msgid ""
"After this move, the user is\n"
"more easily startled."
msgstr ""
"使用后，自己会\n"
"更容易受到惊吓。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:25
msgid ""
"Makes a great appeal, but\n"
"allows no more to the end."
msgstr ""
"能进行很棒的表演，\n"
"但之后无法再表演。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:33
msgid ""
"Can be repeatedly used\n"
"without boring the JUDGE."
msgstr ""
"即使连续使用，\n"
"评审也不会感到厌烦。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:41
msgid ""
"Can avoid being startled\n"
"by others once."
msgstr ""
"能避免1次\n"
"被其他宝可梦惊吓。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:49
msgid ""
"Can avoid being startled\n"
"by others."
msgstr ""
"能避免被其他\n"
"宝可梦惊吓。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:57
msgid ""
"Can avoid being startled\n"
"by others a little."
msgstr ""
"能稍微避免\n"
"被其他宝可梦惊吓。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:65
msgid ""
"After this move, the user is\n"
"less likely to be startled."
msgstr ""
"使用后，自己会\n"
"更不容易受到惊吓。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:73
msgid ""
"Slightly startles the\n"
"POKéMON in front."
msgstr ""
"稍微惊吓\n"
"前面1只宝可梦。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:81
msgid ""
"Slightly startles those\n"
"that have made appeals."
msgstr ""
"稍微惊吓\n"
"已经表演过的宝可梦。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:90
msgid ""
"Startles the last Pokémon\n"
"to act before the user."
msgstr ""
"惊吓在自己之前\n"
"最后表演的宝可梦。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:92 src/data/contest_moves.h:129
msgid ""
"Startles the POKéMON that\n"
"appealed before the user."
msgstr ""
"惊吓在自己之前\n"
"表演的宝可梦。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:102
msgid ""
"Startles all of the Pokémon\n"
"to act before the user."
msgstr ""
"惊吓在自己之前\n"
"表演的所有宝可梦。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:104 src/data/contest_moves.h:137
msgid ""
"Startles all POKéMON that\n"
"have done their appeals."
msgstr ""
"惊吓已经表演过的\n"
"所有宝可梦。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:113
msgid ""
"Badly startles the\n"
"POKéMON in front."
msgstr ""
"狠狠惊吓\n"
"前面1只宝可梦。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:121
msgid ""
"Badly startles those that\n"
"have made appeals."
msgstr ""
"狠狠惊吓\n"
"已经表演过的宝可梦。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:146
msgid ""
"Makes audience expect\n"
"little of other contestants."
msgstr ""
"让观众对其他参赛者\n"
"不抱期待。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:148
msgid ""
"Shifts the JUDGE's\n"
"attention from others."
msgstr ""
"转移评审对\n"
"其他宝可梦的注意。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:157
msgid ""
"Startles the POKéMON that\n"
"has the JUDGE's attention."
msgstr ""
"惊吓受到评审\n"
"关注的宝可梦。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:165
msgid ""
"Jams the others, and misses\n"
"one turn of appeals."
msgstr ""
"妨碍其他宝可梦，\n"
"但下回合无法表演。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:173
msgid ""
"Startles POKéMON that\n"
"made a same-type appeal."
msgstr ""
"惊吓进行了\n"
"同类表演的宝可梦。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:181
msgid ""
"Badly startles POKéMON\n"
"that made COOL appeals."
msgstr ""
"狠狠惊吓进行了\n"
"帅气表演的宝可梦。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:189
msgid ""
"Badly startles POKéMON\n"
"that made BEAUTY appeals."
msgstr ""
"狠狠惊吓进行了\n"
"美丽表演的宝可梦。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:197
msgid ""
"Badly startles POKéMON\n"
"that made CUTE appeals."
msgstr ""
"狠狠惊吓进行了\n"
"可爱表演的宝可梦。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:205
msgid ""
"Badly startles POKéMON\n"
"that made SMART appeals."
msgstr ""
"狠狠惊吓进行了\n"
"聪明表演的宝可梦。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:213
msgid ""
"Badly startles POKéMON\n"
"that made TOUGH appeals."
msgstr ""
"狠狠惊吓进行了\n"
"强壮表演的宝可梦。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:221
msgid ""
"Makes one POKéMON after\n"
"the user nervous."
msgstr ""
"让自己之后的\n"
"1只宝可梦紧张。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:230
msgid ""
"Makes the remaining\n"
"Pokémon nervous."
msgstr ""
"让剩下的宝可梦\n"
"变得紧张。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:232
msgid ""
"Makes all POKéMON after\n"
"the user nervous."
msgstr ""
"让自己之后的\n"
"所有宝可梦紧张。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:241
msgid ""
"Worsens the condition of\n"
"those that made appeals."
msgstr ""
"让已经表演过的\n"
"宝可梦状态变差。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:249
msgid ""
"Badly startles POKéMON in\n"
"good condition."
msgstr ""
"狠狠惊吓\n"
"状态良好的宝可梦。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:257
msgid ""
"The appeal works great if\n"
"performed first."
msgstr ""
"第1个表演时\n"
"效果非常好。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:265
msgid ""
"The appeal works great if\n"
"performed last."
msgstr ""
"最后表演时\n"
"效果非常好。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:273
msgid ""
"Makes the appeal as good\n"
"as those before it."
msgstr ""
"表演效果和之前的\n"
"表演一样好。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:281
msgid ""
"Makes the appeal as good\n"
"as the one before it."
msgstr ""
"表演效果和前1个\n"
"表演一样好。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:289
msgid ""
"The appeal works better\n"
"the later it is performed."
msgstr ""
"越晚表演，\n"
"效果越好。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:298
msgid ""
"Effectiveness varies\n"
"depending on when it is used."
msgstr ""
"效果会随\n"
"使用时机而改变。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:300
msgid ""
"The appeal's quality varies\n"
"depending on its timing."
msgstr ""
"表演的好坏会随\n"
"时机而改变。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:309
msgid ""
"Works well if it's the same\n"
"type as the one before."
msgstr ""
"和前1个表演属性相同\n"
"时效果很好。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:317
msgid ""
"Works well if different in\n"
"type than the one before."
msgstr ""
"和前1个表演属性不同\n"
"时效果很好。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:326
msgid ""
"Affected by how well the\n"
"previous Pokémon's move went."
msgstr ""
"受到前1只宝可梦\n"
"表演好坏的影响。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:328
msgid ""
"Affected by how well the\n"
"appeal in front goes."
msgstr ""
"受到前面表演\n"
"好坏的影响。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:337
msgid ""
"Ups the user's condition.\n"
"Helps prevent nervousness."
msgstr ""
"提高自己的状态，\n"
"不容易紧张。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:345
msgid ""
"The appeal works well if the\n"
"user's condition is good."
msgstr ""
"自己状态良好时，\n"
"表演效果很好。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:354
msgid ""
"Causes the user to move\n"
"earlier on the next turn."
msgstr ""
"下回合能\n"
"更早表演。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:356
msgid ""
"The next appeal can be\n"
"made earlier next turn."
msgstr ""
"下回合能\n"
"更早进行表演。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:366
msgid ""
"Causes the user to move\n"
"later on the next turn."
msgstr ""
"下回合会\n"
"更晚表演。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:368
msgid ""
"The next appeal can be\n"
"made later next turn."
msgstr ""
"下回合会\n"
"更晚进行表演。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:377
msgid ""
"Makes the next turn's order\n"
"more easily scrambled."
msgstr ""
"下回合的表演顺序\n"
"更容易被打乱。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:385
msgid ""
"Scrambles the order of\n"
"appeals on the next turn."
msgstr ""
"打乱下回合的\n"
"表演顺序。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:393
msgid ""
"An appeal that excites the\n"
"audience in any CONTEST."
msgstr ""
"在任何华丽大赛中\n"
"都能让观众热烈起来。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:401
msgid ""
"Badly startles all POKéMON\n"
"that made good appeals."
msgstr ""
"狠狠惊吓表演效果\n"
"很好的所有宝可梦。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:409
msgid ""
"The appeal works best the\n"
"more the crowd is excited."
msgstr ""
"观众越热烈，\n"
"表演效果越好。"

#: src/data/contest_moves.h:417
msgid ""
"Temporarily stops the\n"
"crowd from growing excited."
msgstr ""
"暂时让观众\n"
"无法热烈起来。"
